		font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 2.9cqw, 0.95rem);
		line-height: 1.15;
		text-align: center;
		transition:
			scale 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.25s,
			opacity 0.3s 0.25s,
			background 0.3s,
			color 0.3s,
			box-shadow 0.3s;
